---
layout: layouts/default.liquid
tmpl: page
---
{% comment %} Task 18 (§7.4): was layouts/base.liquid, which skips the rail/nav
   AND the skip link (default.liquid:10-46) entirely — the six post-type
   permalink pages built through this layout had no skip link and no
   id="skiplink-content" target at all, only the homepage did. Routing
   through default.liquid instead of duplicating the skip link/main markup
   here fixes it once for every post type, matching how page.liquid already
   does it. default.liquid adds no wrapper around {{ content }} besides
   <main>, so the h-entry markup below is unaffected. {% endcomment %}
{%- comment %} This render is the whole point of the page (unlike
   post-list-entry.liquid, which renders the same type partials in a loop
   further down the homepage) — its own image, if it has one, is the page's
   LCP candidate. See types/photo.liquid. {% endcomment -%}
{%- assign lcp = true -%}
{%- comment %} Task S3 (audit §2.3): <h1 class="p-name primary-title"> lives
   here, not in types/article.liquid — that partial is shared with
   post-list-entry.liquid's feed loop, and a heading baked into it produced a
   second homepage <h1> and zero on the five titleless permalink types. It
   has to sit *inside* <article class="h-entry"> to count as that entry's
   p-name to a real mf2 parser (the exact class of bug already fixed once
   for u-url, see post-list-entry.liquid's own comment) — so the article/
   h-entry wrapper moves here too, and the type partials render body-only
   (mirrors the same pattern already used, unreachably, by layouts/
   page.liquid). Each type partial's own <a class="u-url"> still supplies
   p-name for the feed-listing render, where this <h1> never appears — see
   types/article.liquid for how it tells the two contexts apart. {% endcomment -%}
<article class="h-entry">
  <h1 class="p-name primary-title">{{ title }}</h1>
  {% case postType %}
    {% when "article" %}{% include "types/article.liquid" %}
    {% when "bookmark" %}{% include "types/bookmark.liquid" %}
    {% when "like" %}{% include "types/like.liquid" %}
    {% when "photo" %}{% include "types/photo.liquid" %}
    {% when "reply" %}{% include "types/reply.liquid" %}
    {% else %}{% include "types/note.liquid" %}
  {% endcase %}
</article>

{%- capture absoluteUrl %}{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}{% endcapture -%}
{% include "webmentionlist.liquid" %}
